OL,3,GNEWSA'I raised #100,000 to fund my stem
OL,4,Acell treatment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who had to raise more than
OL,7,F#100,000 to fund her stem cell
OL,8,Ftreatment is calling for the NHS in
OL,9,FEngland to change its rules on
OL,10,Ftransplants.
OL,12,FFaith Hinitt, from Retford in
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, was diagnosed with
OL,14,Facute myeloid leukaemia (AML) in
OL,15,FOctober 2023. Although she received her
OL,16,Ffirst stem cell transplant on the NHS,
OL,17,Fshe was refused a second treatment when
OL,18,Fshe relapsed within a year.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
