OL,3,GNEWSA'I raised #100,000 to fund my stem
OL,4,Acell treatment'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 28-year-old is now supporting a
OL,7,Fnational campaign - launched on
OL,8,FWednesday by three charities - for NHS
OL,9,FEngland to review its policy.
OL,11,FNHS England said it had commissioned
OL,12,F"an independent evidence review into
OL,13,Fthe case for a second allogeneic stem
OL,14,Fcell transplant".
